ESSIVE UPGRADES</strong> - Collect powerful items and chips throughout your campaign. Each choice shapes your strategy and defines your combat style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/5a01bbacff6f70b702e03b26110e229c.poster.avif?t=1749723842\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/5a01bbacff6f70b702e03b26110e229c.webm?t=1749723842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127770/extras/5a01bbacff6f70b702e03b26110e229c.mp4?t=1749723842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version is actively being developed with regular updates based on player feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP mode is also now available in beta! The roguelike campaign is just the beginning of your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mech is the carrier of strength. Your cards are the reach of that strength. Build your strategy and fight for victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to us on Discord | Follow us on X</p>",
